0 FILE meridian-linkage.ldr
0 Meridian - Exact Straight-Line Linkage
0 Name: meridian-linkage.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/meridian-linkage.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Original Meridian design assembled with OpenAI assistance.
0 // New native PlacedModel exported by the unchanged Brickwright serializeModel function.
0 // Application Author is the native serializer default; design provenance is stated above.
0 // Peaucellier-Lipkin circle inversion produces an exact ideal straight-line locus.
0 // One bounded motor crank drives seven moving links; the output point is passive.
0 // All motion comes from stock connections and unmodified native physics.
0 // Companion: meridian-linkage.bw. Robot Lab Plain; open model, then Code > To blocks.
0 // Reset the complete model before running and before repeating the demonstration.
0 // Use the supplied bounded program; a complete motor revolution is not permitted.
0 // Digital kinematic demonstrator; physical assembly and output loading are untested.
